  "body": "It appears to me that https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#translation-mode isn't explicit about what the translation mode is if an element has no parent but also isn't a document element, for instance if it's a document fragment or a shadow root or just a created element that isn't attached to anything.\r\n\r\ndocument.createElement(\"div\").translate is true in Chrome, so I'm guessing the \"if the element is a document element\" phrase should actually be something more inclusive like \"if the element is the root of its tree\".",
